{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17209630","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17209630","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1720963001:1":{"text":"어이, 거기! 여기서 뭐 하냐? 길을 잘못 든 거 같은데?","source_cn":"站住，你们走错路了吧？这是你们的地盘吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x46421C2D1B773025","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"어이, 거기! 여기서 뭐 하냐? 길을 잘못 든 거 같은데?","female":"어이, 거기! 여기서 뭐 하냐? 길을 잘못 든 거 같은데?","variant_male_record_index":"228624","variant_female_record_index":"228625","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1720963002:1":{"text":"아이, 형님들도 참. 저희야 그냥 부두 구경이나 좀 하려고...","source_cn":"哎，几位好兄弟误会了，我们就是随便逛逛，欣赏欣赏码头的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB4CE5289083309E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1720963003:1":{"text":"구경? 가서 네 얼굴이나 구경하지 그래? 눈치 있으면 당장 썩 꺼져!","source_cn":"风景？我劝你们还是去看看自己脸上的风景吧！识相的，就赶...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1FA0A574186A4658","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1720963004:1":{"text":"형님, 말 섞지 마시죠. 주인님께서 누구도 접근 못 하게 하라고 하셨잖습니까!","source_cn":"大哥，还跟他们废什么话，老爷交代了谁都不准靠近！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4980C2ED60CF40D7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1720963005:1":{"text":"수사 중인 근위대다. 공무 집행을 방해할 셈인가?","source_cn":"守备军在此办案，你们是要妨碍公务吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7CB781CFF61C20C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1720963006:1":{"text":"형님, 근위대입니다. 어, 어떡할까요?","source_cn":"大哥，守备军来了！怎、怎么办啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x097EFC547F9AF503","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1720963007:1":{"text":"근위대? 참나, 근위대면 뭐! 오늘 우리 규칙을 제대로 알려주지!","source_cn":"守备军？哼，这里可不是你们的地盘！今天就让你们知道知道...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xA05878C758CFD7CB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"근위대? 참나, 근위대면 뭐! 오늘 우리 규칙을 제대로 알려주지!","female":"근위대? 참나, 근위대면 뭐! 오늘 우리 규칙을 제대로 알려주지!","variant_male_record_index":"228631","variant_female_record_index":"228632","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮横的混混":{"text":"건달","source":"蛮横的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:记者马斯卡":{"text":"기자 마스카","source":"记者马斯卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:无礼的混混":{"text":"무례한 불량배","source":"无礼的混混","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:亨德里克":{"text":"헨드릭","source":"亨德里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":4}}